    "detailed_description": "My Life of Repayment is a simulation game with debt repayment as the core.<br>The player will play the role of a cat who has just graduated from college, working around to pay off debts.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage finances, time and physical state</strong></h2>Players need to properly allocate time and money, replenish vigor, saturation and mood after work, and repay debts regularly.<br>Use the remaining money to buy food, or items that can improve your work efficiency.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse work experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Archery Performer: physical simulation gameplay that emphasizes operation<br></li><li>Drone Operator: A roguelite TD<br></li><li>Pancake Cook: cooking simulation with reaction capability + time management</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "My Life of Repayment is a simulation game with debt repayment as the core.<br>The player will play the role of a cat who has just graduated from college, working around to pay off debts.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage finances, time and physical state</strong></h2>Players need to properly allocate time and money, replenish vigor, saturation and mood after work, and repay debts regularly.<br>Use the remaining money to buy food, or items that can improve your work efficiency.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse work experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Archery Performer: physical simulation gameplay that emphasizes operation<br></li><li>Drone Operator: A roguelite TD<br></li><li>Pancake Cook: cooking simulation with reaction capability + time management</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "If you don't work, you will eat dirt! To pay off your loans, you will take on various jobs. Make pancakes, perform archery, and operate a space drone! Enjoy a changeable work experience in your busy life!",
